    "title": "Homer Pets of the Week: 6 cuddly cats",
    "text": "Bezel, Bo Cieves, Isaiah, Too Bee, Buffy and Saghosa are 3 males and 3 females up for adoption at the Homer Animal Shelter.\nIt may be hard to tell, but there are 6 sweet cats in this cuddle puddle. They are all related and in the 1-2 year age range. They’re obviously a shy group, but they’re a sweet and gentle group. They would benefit from fosters or patient adopters. If you give these cats a chance, they will surely give you a life full of love.\nDon’t worry, the six of them don’t have to go together, but they wouldn’t mind going in pairs. Please call us for details and an appointment to meet them.\nTo make an appointment to visit the Pets of the Week, call the Homer Animal Shelter at 907-235-3141.",
    "summary": "Homer Pets of the Week: 6 cuddly cats Published 5:30 pm Wednesday, August 26, 2026 Bezel, Bo Cieves, Isaiah, Too Bee, Buffy and Saghosa are 3 males and 3 females up for adoption at the Homer Animal Shelter. It may be hard to tell, but there are 6 sweet cats in this cuddle puddle. They are all related and in the 1-2 year age range. Please call us for details and an appointment to meet them. To make an appointment to visit the Pets of the Week, call the Homer Animal Shelter at 907-235-3141.",
